Yeah, I mean, typically a sitcom is four million, three and a half, two and a half.
是啊，我的意思是，通常一部情景喜剧的预算是四百万、三百五十万，或者二百五十万。

753
00:30:34.860 --> 00:30:35.360
Per episode.
每集。

754
00:30:35.920 --> 00:30:36.340
Yes.
没错。

755
00:30:36.680 --> 00:30:37.080
Oh, wow.
哇，天哪。

756
00:30:37.080 --> 00:30:45.060
And I think at that time, we were at a million five, million four.
我觉得当时我们的预算是一百五十万，或者一百四十万。

757
00:30:45.400 --> 00:30:51.660
And we had to take $400,000 off of a budget that was this big.
我们不得不从这么大的预算里砍掉四十万美元。

758
00:30:51.980 --> 00:30:53.740
I'm making a teeny tiny circle.
我正在比划一个极小的圆圈。

759
00:30:54.060 --> 00:30:57.960
It was a tiny budget as half hours went.
以半小时剧集来说，那预算真的很小。

760
00:30:58.180 --> 00:31:02.400
Is that why all the episodes in the first season happen in the bullpen and in the office?
所以第一季的所有剧集才都发生在办公区和办公室里吗？

761
00:31:02.600 --> 00:31:03.540
Like, there's no...
就是说，没有……

762
00:31:03.540 --> 00:31:04.700
Ding, ding, ding, ding, ding.
叮，叮，叮，叮，叮。

763
00:31:04.940 --> 00:31:05.800
There's no locations.
没有外景。

764
00:31:05.800 --> 00:31:06.520
Zip.
完全没有。

765
00:31:06.660 --> 00:31:07.640
We couldn't afford to leave.
我们根本出不起外景。

766
00:31:09.200 --> 00:31:12.580
Everything had to be contained because it costs money to go out.
所有场景都必须局限在室内，因为出门就要花钱。

767
00:31:12.840 --> 00:31:13.060
Yeah.
是啊。

768
00:31:13.460 --> 00:31:14.760
It costs money to move cameras.
移动摄影机要花钱。

769
00:31:14.920 --> 00:31:16.160
