所有那些你离开拍摄地时必须要做的事情，都要花钱。

771
00:31:23.040 --> 00:31:30.760
And so Ben was gallivanting all over the world with his friend who had just done a big movie with Brad Pitt.
当时本正和他的朋友四处游玩，他朋友刚和布拉德·皮特拍了一部大片。

772
00:31:30.760 --> 00:31:35.560
He was on a studio private plane, I don't know, Warner Brothers or Sony or something.
他当时坐的是制片厂的私人飞机，我不知道，可能是华纳兄弟或者索尼之类的。

773
00:31:35.920 --> 00:31:43.120
And I think he was in, he was somewhere where it was, in the middle of the night for me, was morning for him.
我想他当时在某个地方，对我来说是半夜，对他来说是早上。

774
00:31:43.540 --> 00:31:45.000
On a plane with Brad Pitt.
和布拉德·皮特在飞机上。

775
00:31:45.080 --> 00:31:47.640
On a plane and doing all the premieres around the world.
在飞机上，还要去世界各地参加各种首映礼。

776
00:31:47.720 --> 00:31:47.880
Okay.
好吧。

777
00:31:48.540 --> 00:31:52.360
And here I am in my underwear, in the middle of the night, sitting in my bed.
而我呢，半夜穿着内衣坐在床上。

778
00:31:52.440 --> 00:31:56.860
I have spreadsheets all over my bed, the budget everywhere.
床上铺满了电子表格，到处都是预算表。

779
00:31:57.320 --> 00:32:04.480
And I'm trying to figure out how to get $400,000 out of this budget so that we can get picked up for five more episodes.
我正绞尽脑汁想从预算里省出四十万美元，好让我们能续订五集。

780
00:32:04.700 --> 00:32:06.000
And we finally got there.
最后我们终于做到了。

781
00:32:06.040 --> 00:32:10.780
But it was literally the day before we got you guys on a plane to go to New York.
但那真的是在你们坐飞机去纽约的前一天。

782
00:32:11.320 --> 00:32:12.420
Well, actually.
嗯，其实。

783
00:32:12.540 --> 00:32:12.980
Did we go?
我们去了吗？

784
